# ── Sensitive analyst material — must NEVER end up in git ───────────────
# Customer alerts, malware samples, forensics reports may contain PII or
# real attacker artifacts. If you need to share one for debugging, do it
# out-of-band.
samples/
malware/
reports/malware-analysis/
*.malware
*.suspect
*.sample

# ── Logs / runtime artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
.local/

# ── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.whl
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# ── Internal-only material — NEVER publish ──────────────────────────────
# Named-competitor teardown, RAG deployment post-mortem with real tenant
# scores, and internal marketing/roadmap notes. Kept on disk for reference,
# excluded from the public repo.
_internal/
